---
/** PullQuote (DESIGN-SPEC v2 10.9): `.t-pull` in Imperial with big Orchid hand-drawn quote marks (Caveat glyphs,
 * aria-hidden) and a 4px Orchid bar on the left. One per 1,000 words at most. */
---
<blockquote class="pull" data-reveal><span class="pull__mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span><p class="t-pull pull__text"><slot /></p><span class="pull__mark pull__mark--end" aria-hidden="true">”</span></blockquote>
<style>
  .pull {
    position: relative;
    margin-block: var(--s-9);
    padding: var(--s-3) 0 var(--s-3) var(--s-7);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--kk-orchid);
  }
  .pull__text { margin: 0; color: var(--kk-imperial); font-variant-numeric: lining-nums; max-width: 20ch; text-wrap: balance; }
  :global(.prose) .pull__text { font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.3rem + 2.6vw, 3.25rem); line-height: .98; }
  .pull__mark { position: absolute; left: var(--s-3); top: -.38em; font-family: var(--font-hand); font-weight: 700; font-size: 6rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--kk-orchid); rotate: -8deg; }
  .pull__mark--end { position: relative; left: auto; top: .32em; display: inline-block; margin-left: .1em; font-size: 4.5rem; rotate: 6deg; line-height: 0; }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .pull { margin-inline-start: -32px; } }
</style>
